{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:3670f67c5cf594a9","name":"Bracer Computer","source":{"id":"source:reference-3670f67c5cf594a9","title":"Bracer Computer","revision":16369,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:46Z","sha256":"67aad07e604ac94c25d1026ec4b4c1916e203d8b38d48bb55a07f832f3002dcf","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16369","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Bracer%20Computer&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-3670f67c5cf594a9","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,300\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Bracer Computer is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Datapad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Datapad","referenceId":"reference:7a32da74ac188805"}," worn on the user's forearm. It performs all the same functions as the standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Datapad"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Datapad","referenceId":"reference:7a32da74ac188805"},", including the ability to read standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Datacards"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Datacards"}," in a slot on the underside of the device. The Bracer Computer also features a holographic screen that displays information as a two-dimensional image about three centimeters above the device. Plus, the keyboard is designed to accommodate one-handed typing.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Bracer Computer is popular among those who need to conserve space with their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"},", particularly bounty hunters. A Bracer Computer has an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," score of 12.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
